{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    " · from Watch" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : " · 来自手表"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ only" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ resumed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 已续收"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ saved" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 已保存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ started" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 已开始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld of %lld" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld / %2$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld Selected" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已选择 %lld 张"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "© %@ %@. Apricot SSTV is free software: you can redistribute it and modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License, version 3. It comes with no warranty. Its decoder began as Apricot SSTV for the iPod nano." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "© %1$@ %2$@。Apricot SSTV 是自由软件：你可以依照 GNU 通用公共许可证第 3 版的条款重新分发和修改它。本软件不提供任何担保。它的解码器源自 iPod nano 版的 Apricot SSTV。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A missed start" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "漏掉了开头"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A picture was sent but nothing happened." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有人发了图片，但没有反应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About Apricot SSTV" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关于 Apricot SSTV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust Photo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调整照片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust Position and Size" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调整位置和大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust the radio's volume so the Level bar stays in the green, roughly −30 to −10 dB. If it turns red and says Clipping, turn the radio down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调节电台音量，让电平条保持在绿色区间，大约 −30 到 −10 dB。如果变红并显示“削波”，就把电台音量调低。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All Pictures" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全部图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Watch" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Watch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apricot SSTV" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apricot SSTV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apricot SSTV collects no data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apricot SSTV 不收集任何数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apricot SSTV turns the sound of slow-scan television into pictures. Tune your radio to a frequency where SSTV is sent, and let your iPhone or Apple Watch hear it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apricot SSTV 能把慢扫描电视（SSTV）的声音还原成图片。把电台调到有 SSTV 信号的频率，让 iPhone 或 Apple Watch 听到它就行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio lost" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "丢失的音频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic finds the mode from each picture's VIS header. Choose a mode to receive only that one. Start Without VIS locks on to the line syncs when the header was missed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“自动”会根据每张图片的 VIS 头识别模式。选择某个模式则只接收这一种。“无 VIS 也开始”会在漏掉 VIS 头时按行同步锁定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic suits most listening. If you know what's coming, such as PD120 from the International Space Station, choose that mode in Settings or the ⋯ menu on Receive. Other modes are then ignored, which also avoids false starts in noise." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "大多数情况下用“自动”即可。如果你知道将要收到什么，例如国际空间站的 PD120，可以在“设置”或“接收”页的 ⋯ 菜单中选择该模式。之后其他模式会被忽略，这也能避免在噪声中误触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "By %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作者：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Callsign" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "呼号"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can't send: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法发送：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can't start: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法开始：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change Photo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更换照片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check before going on the air" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发射前先检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check that the Level bar moves, that Mode is Automatic or matches the picture, and that the tuning marker sits near 1900 Hz during the VIS header. Weak or distorted audio can hide the header; Start Without VIS helps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查电平条是否在动、模式是否为“自动”或与图片一致，以及 VIS 头期间调谐标记是否在 1900 Hz 附近。音频太弱或失真可能听不出 VIS 头，这时“无 VIS 也开始”会有帮助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a Photo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择一张照片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a photo to send." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择要发送的照片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a photo, then tap it to move and zoom it in the frame. Your callsign is drawn at the top left; add a second line, such as a signal report, if you like." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择一张照片，然后轻点它，在画面中移动和缩放。你的呼号会画在左上角；也可以再加一行，例如信号报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose All Pictures in the menu at the top right." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在右上角的菜单中选择“全部图片”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Photo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择照片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choosing a mode" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear Picture" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "清除图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CLIP" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "削波"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clipping" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "削波"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clock" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "时钟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Complete" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完整"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect the audio" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接音频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect the audio output (headphone adapter or USB interface) to the radio's audio input; the iPhone's volume sets the level. Before sending on the air with a new setup, share a WAV (top left) and check it with another SSTV decoder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将音频输出（耳机转接器或 USB 声卡）连接到电台的音频输入，用 iPhone 的音量调节电平。使用新设置正式发射前，请先分享一个 WAV 文件（左上角），并用其他 SSTV 解码器检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect the iPhone's audio output (a headphone adapter or a USB audio interface) to the radio's microphone or data input, and turn on VOX so the radio transmits when it hears the audio. The iPhone's volume sets the level: start low and raise it until the radio's ALC just begins to move." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把 iPhone 的音频输出（耳机转接器或 USB 声卡）接到电台的话筒或数据输入，并打开 VOX，让电台听到音频时自动发射。用 iPhone 的音量调节电平：从小音量开始，逐渐调大，直到电台的 ALC 刚开始动作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect the radio" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接电台"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not write image.png" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法写入 image.png"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't Make the WAV" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法生成 WAV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "decoder could not start" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "解码器无法启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete %lld pictures already on the iPhone?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要删除 iPhone 上已有的 %lld 张图片吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete %lld pictures?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要删除 %lld 张图片吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete all %lld pictures from this iPhone?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要从这台 iPhone 删除全部 %lld 张图片吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete All Pictures" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除所有图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete Synced (%lld)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除已同步的（%lld）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete Synced, in the watch's Pictures, removes the pictures the iPhone already has." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手表“图片”里的“删除已同步的”会删除 iPhone 上已有的图片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete this picture from the watch?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要从手表上删除这张图片吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete this picture?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要删除这张图片吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deselect All" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "取消全选"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Does Apricot SSTV collect any data?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apricot SSTV 会收集数据吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to move, pinch to zoom, double-tap to switch between fill and fit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拖移可移动，双指捏合可缩放，轻点两下可在填满与完整显示之间切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drawn at the top left of every picture you send, to identify your station." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "画在每张发送图片的左上角，用来表明你的电台身份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Either that mode isn't one of the 14 that Apricot SSTV handles, or you chose a single mode and this picture is a different one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要么这个模式不在 Apricot SSTV 支持的 14 种之内，要么你只选择了一种模式，而这张图片是别的模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Encoding %@…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在编码 %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ended" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "结束方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every mode can be received and sent, with the VIS header or, when it was missed, from the line syncs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每种模式都可以接收和发送；可以通过 VIS 头识别，漏掉 VIS 头时也可以通过行同步识别。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every saved picture goes to the iPhone by itself when the iPhone app is installed and the two are near each other. You don't need to open either app. In the watch's Pictures, a phone icon marks the ones the iPhone already has." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只要 iPhone 上装了 App 且两台设备在附近，每张保存的图片都会自动传到 iPhone，无需打开任何一边的 App。在手表的“图片”中，带手机图标的表示 iPhone 上已经有了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fades and gaps" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "衰落和中断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fill Frame" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "填满画面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Filter" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "筛选"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fit Whole Photo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完整显示照片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free Software" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自由软件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free software under the GNU GPL v3, with no warranty." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "依照 GNU GPL v3 发布的自由软件，不提供任何担保。"
