      }
    },
    "Hold the iPhone near the radio's speaker, or, for a much cleaner signal, connect the radio's audio output to a USB audio interface plugged into the iPhone. Receive shows which input is in use." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把 iPhone 放在电台扬声器旁边；想要干净得多的信号，可以把电台的音频输出接到插在 iPhone 上的 USB 声卡。“接收”页会显示当前使用的输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the sender's clock runs a little fast or slow, a picture would lean. Apricot SSTV measures this from the line syncs and straightens the picture as it goes; Sender's clock shows the difference in ppm." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果发送方的时钟稍快或稍慢，图片就会倾斜。Apricot SSTV 会根据行同步测出这个偏差，边接收边把图片拉直；“发送方时钟”以 ppm 显示这个偏差。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the signal fades or the audio is interrupted, the picture carries on at the right line when it comes back within two minutes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果信号衰落或音频中断，只要在两分钟内恢复，图片会从正确的那一行继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If this policy ever changes, the new version will be in the app and on the website before it applies." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果本政策有任何变更，新版本会在生效前发布在 App 和网站上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
