    "iPod nano Version" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPod nano 版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It says a mode was skipped." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提示某个模式被跳过了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its marks are the tones SSTV uses: 1200 Hz (sync), 1500 Hz (black), 1900 Hz (the VIS leader) and 2300 Hz (white). During a picture the marker moves between black and white; a steady 1900 Hz means a picture is about to start. Tuning errors up to ±150 Hz are corrected from the VIS header." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "刻度对应 SSTV 使用的音调：1200 Hz（同步）、1500 Hz（黑）、1900 Hz（VIS 引导音）和 2300 Hz（白）。接收图片时，标记在黑与白之间移动；稳定停在 1900 Hz 表示一张图片即将开始。±150 Hz 以内的调谐误差会根据 VIS 头自动校正。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
