            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No ads, no account. Nothing is collected or sent anywhere; pictures only move between your watch and your iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有广告，不需要账户。不收集任何数据，也不向任何地方发送；图片只在你的手表和 iPhone 之间传输。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No ads, no analytics, no accounts and no third-party code. The app makes no internet connections of its own; a link you tap opens in Safari." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有广告，没有统计分析，没有账户，也没有第三方代码。App 本身不会进行任何网络连接；你轻点的链接会在 Safari 中打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No ads, no subscriptions, no account." : {
