            "value" : "没有可用的麦克风输入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No. There are no ads, no accounts and no analytics. Nothing leaves your devices, except pictures going from your watch to your iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不会。没有广告，没有账户，也没有统计分析。除了图片从手表传到 iPhone，没有任何东西离开你的设备。"
          }
