            "value" : "保存在你的设备上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the photo you choose to send is read, to make the picture; Apricot SSTV can't see the rest of your library. A picture is added to Photos only when you save it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只读取你选择发送的那张照片，用来生成图片；Apricot SSTV 看不到你图库中的其他内容。只有在你保存时，图片才会被存入“照片”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Apricot SSTV on the watch, tap Listen, and keep the watch near the radio's speaker. You can lower your wrist: receiving carries on, and the watch taps you when a picture starts and when it's saved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在手表上打开 Apricot SSTV，轻点“接收”，让手表靠近电台扬声器。放下手腕后接收会继续；图片开始和保存时，手表会轻触提醒你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
