            "value" : "手表上的图片没有传到 iPhone。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pictures go from your watch to your iPhone directly, over Apple's own connection between the two. They don't pass through any server of ours." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片通过 Apple 提供的手表与 iPhone 之间的连接直接传输，不经过我们的任何服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pictures go to the iPhone once its Apricot SSTV app is installed and nearby." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
