    },
    "Tap Listen" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点“接收”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Listen. When a picture's VIS header is heard, the picture builds line by line, and it is saved to Pictures when it ends. You can lock the iPhone: receiving carries on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点“接收”。听到图片的 VIS 头后，图片会一行一行地出现，结束时自动存入“图片”。锁定 iPhone 后接收也会继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Send. Receiving stops while sending. Keep the radio connected until the progress bar finishes; you can lock the iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点“发送”。发送时会停止接收。在进度条走完之前保持电台连接；可以锁定 iPhone。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Send. The radio keys on VOX." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点“发送”，电台由 VOX 自动发射。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text on the picture" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片上的文字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the chosen mode" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所选模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the encoder failed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "编码器出错"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The frame is %lld × %lld. Tap the picture or Adjust to move and zoom the photo in it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "画面为 %1$lld × %2$lld。轻点图片或“调整”可在画面中移动、缩放照片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The iPhone app must be installed, and the watch and iPhone near each other. Transfers wait and finish by themselves. Settings shows whether the watch app is installed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要 iPhone 上装有 App，并且手表和 iPhone 在附近。传输会自动等待并完成。“设置”里可以看到手表 App 是否已安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The picture is noisy or the colors are wrong." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片噪点多或颜色不对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pictures you receive, their details, and your settings (such as the mode and your callsign) are kept only in the app on your iPhone and Apple Watch. Deleting a picture, or the app, removes them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你收到的图片、图片的接收信息以及你的设置（例如模式和呼号）只保存在 iPhone 和 Apple Watch 上的本 App 中。删除图片或删除 App 即会将其移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tuning bar" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调谐条"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This picture isn't on the iPhone yet. Delete it?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这张图片还没传到 iPhone。要删除吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tone" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "音调"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too loud: turn the radio down" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "太响了：请调低电台音量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too loud: turn the radio down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "太响了：请调低电台音量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transmitting needs an amateur radio license and must follow its rules, including identifying your station." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发射需要业余无线电执照，并须遵守执照的相关规定，包括表明你的电台身份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tuning offset" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调谐偏移"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updated %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更新于 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used only while Listen is on, to decode pictures as they arrive. The sound isn't recorded, saved or sent anywhere." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅在“接收”开启时使用，用于实时解码收到的图片。声音不会被录制、保存或发送到任何地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Usually it's the level: too low lets noise in, too high (Clipping) distorts the tones. A cable or USB interface is much cleaner than a microphone held to a speaker." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通常是电平问题：太低会混入噪声，太高（削波）会让音调失真。用连接线或 USB 声卡，比把麦克风对着扬声器干净得多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "版本 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VIS header" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VIS 头"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for a picture" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for VIS" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待 VIS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch app not installed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手表 App 未安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Website" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What It Does" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "功能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With a new setup, tap the share button to make a WAV and decode it with another SSTV program, or play it to Apricot SSTV on Apple Watch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用新设置时，先轻点分享按钮生成 WAV，用其他 SSTV 程序解码检查，或者放给 Apple Watch 上的 Apricot SSTV 接收。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With Start Without VIS on, a picture whose header was missed still starts after a few lines, from its line syncs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开“无 VIS 也开始”后，即使漏掉了 VIS 头，也会在几行之后根据行同步开始接收。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}